{"id": "lib/compute/derivation_engine.dart:offset-341104", "file": "lib/compute/derivation_engine.dart", "location": "offset-341104", "text": "'no step count: nothing that can resolve gait measured this day. '\n'A 1 Hz wrist stream cannot count steps, so no number is shown '\n'instead of an invented one'", "sha256": "0198b9b36a87442abd540ade57d53bdb982ac989436424650a27dafef5d943fd", "kind": "dart", "start": 341104, "end": 341292, "line": 6381}
{"id": "lib/compute/derivation_engine.dart:offset-346886", "file": "lib/compute/derivation_engine.dart", "location": "offset-346886", "text": "'minutes of sustained wrist movement — activity volume, NOT '\n'walking, and deliberately not converted to steps'", "sha256": "977a9ec90a3f90fb2e7c366ff529c29620250a41f42f5b99498365e813861e38", "kind": "dart", "start": 346886, "end": 347014, "line": 6494}
