{"id": "lib/compute/derivation_engine.dart:offset-361013", "file": "lib/compute/derivation_engine.dart", "location": "offset-361013", "text": "'minutes of wrist movement over wake (1 Hz). This is activity '\n'volume, NOT walking, and is never converted to steps: at the '\n'wrist, arm work registers as strongly as ambulation. Real step '\n'counts come only from the 100 Hz or phone pedometer'", "sha256": "d4b16ecd2d6d8efb4fee2d7729d06483e2ec20be0a6b8156064dc8922ea8af76", "kind": "dart", "start": 361013, "end": 361296, "line": 6785}
{"id": "lib/compute/derivation_engine.dart:offset-393515", "file": "lib/compute/derivation_engine.dart", "location": "offset-393515", "text": "'the strap was charging for part of this night. it stayed on your '\n'wrist and kept recording, so heart rate and beat timing are '\n'measured as usual — but the pack warms the strap, so this night\\'s '\n'skin temperature is not comparable to a night without it, and '\n'clipping the pack on and off registers as wrist movement.'", "sha256": "d8d68c3a103c5b359e268670956c5035d027732046d6f2fa4c5f52ec41e457b6", "kind": "dart", "start": 393515, "end": 393880, "line": 7522}
